- SHADOWMELD: support non-buff events. Although shadowmeld creates a buff, it is an
  unremarkable buff so it would be hard to trigger an event from it. Instead, trigger
  a "tracked event" when a character of interest leaves combat. This tracked event
  will occur no matter how the player left combat (death, enemies died) and will be
  kept around for inference for 0.5s. If, in that 0.5s, other evidence is gathered
  that indicates shadowmeld, good for us.
